## Performance Characteristics

### Discovery Time

| Method | Single Arch | Mixed Arch (2 archs) |
|--------|-------------|----------------------|
| **Old (TT_ALLOW_MIXED_ARCH)** | ~500ms | ❌ THROWS |
| **New (MultiArch)** | ~500ms | ~1000ms (sequential) |

**Note:** Discovery is only done once at initialization. Subsequent telemetry reads are <1ms.

### Memory Overhead

- **Old:** 1 ClusterDescriptor + N TTDevices
- **New:** K ClusterDescriptors (K=num architectures) + N TTDevices

Typical overhead: ~10KB per additional ClusterDescriptor (negligible)

